{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "New Paths", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Just Blurt It Out", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 11, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 1, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.1", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "Describe routines and regular activities in a wider range of social and work contexts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"content": "engenn6le01ob11re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "The Future", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " You can use four different tenses to talk about the future.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "When you talk about things that are not decided or when you make a decision at the moment of speaking for the future, you use the modal <span class=\"italic\">will</span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "With <span class=\"italic\">will</span> you use words like: <span class=\"italic\">perhaps, maybe </span> and  <span class=\"italic\">I think</span>, to show you are still not sure.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "When you ask about intentions, you use <span class=\"italic\">going to</span>. With <span class=\"italic\">going to</span> you often use works like: <span class=\"italic\">sometime, soon</span> and <span class=\"italic\">when I have time</span>, to show you intend to do this, but have not set a specific time.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "When you  talk about things that are arranged, on the agenda or booked for the future, you use the Present Continuous tense. <br>With the Present Continuous, you use specific times and dates to show this event is booked.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Many people use <span class=\"italic\">going to</span> in place of the Present Continuous tense. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You use the Simple Present tense to talk about future schedules. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Will</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">We'll wash up later.</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Going to</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> I'm going to cook him dinner to surprise him!</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Present Continuous</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">He's coming here next week!</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Simple Present </span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">The movie starts at 8 p.m.</span> \\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Personal Qualities and Behavior", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " When you talk about family, you often describe their personalities and their behavior.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Their personality is their general character. The way they are. <br><span class=\"italic\">Example: Sandra is a tidy person. Her apartment is always clean and neat.</span> ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Their behavior is the way they act or conduct themselves. <br><span class=\"italic\">Example: Tom is usually relaxed but today he seems nervous.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "We use adjectives to talk about behavior and personality.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":10,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Adjective\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Synonym\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"fierce\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"relentless; aggressive\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"optimistic\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"hopeful; confident\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"demanding\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"exacting; tough\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"conservative\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"traditional; unprogressive\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"stubborn\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"inflexible; single-minded\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"energetic\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"active; lively\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"ambitious\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"determined; eager\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"adventurous\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"bold; daring\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"enthusiastic\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"keen; passionate\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to clean", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to tidy and do housework ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I have to clean before my family arrives! ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le01ob11aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you have to review.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "demanding", "type": "name"}, {"content": "expecting a lot of effort or work  ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Our manager is very demanding. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le01ob11aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to grill ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to question relentlessly ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: His father will grill you if you go there for dinner.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le01ob11aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "enthusiastic", "type": "name"}, {"content": "being eager and excited  ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: He's enthusiastic about his new job.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le01ob11aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "optimistic", "type": "name"}, {"content": "hopeful and confident  ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: They are optimistic about the future of the company. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le01ob11aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "asset ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "something useful or valuable  ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: She is an asset to the firm. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le01ob11aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "fierce", "type": "name"}, {"content": "aggressive  ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I heard that the new editor is fierce!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le01ob11aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Write about what a friend or family member always, usually, sometimes, hardly ever, and never does.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Mention where your friend or family member goes and what he or she does.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Say if you do this with them or not.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write 75-90 words in a paragraph.", "type": "text