rong\">Vanessa</span>: It's okay. We'll wash up later.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I'm meeting Janette at the movie theater! The film starts at 10! Have to run!<br>", "id": 2, "time": "9000", "image": "engenn6le01ob11re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: That was the best meal ever!  Now, update me on Marco!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: He always  goes to Australia this time of year. He visits his parents, cousins, aunts, and uncles every year. It's a large family!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Uh-huh?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: He's coming here next week! He arrives on Tuesday!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: No way! <br>", "id": 3, "time": "28000", "image": "engenn6le01ob11re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:  I'm going to cook dinner to surprise him!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Let's make it dinner for four! We can grill him!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Good idea! Now what about you?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Well, my articles are going to be featured in a special issue on famous people! <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: That's amazing! Your fierce, demanding editor likes your work!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: She was very enthusiastic and said I was an asset to the magazine.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I can't wait to read them! I'm  very optimistic about our careers!<br>", "id": 4, "time": "51000", "image": "engenn6le01ob11re2img02.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn6le01ob11re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn6le01ob11re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}]}